  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Pour Les Pattounes is a pet sitting service covering Fréjus and Saint-Raphaël. The provider presents herself as a pet sitter, dog trainer and dog and cat behaviourist, and says she has been pet sitting for 12 years. The sitting service is home sitting: visits and walks at the owner's home while they're away. The website is clear on this point: it is not a boarding kennel and no animals are kept at her place.</p>

      <h2>Visits and walks</h2>
      <p>For every type of sitting, a first visit at your home is free to discuss your needs. Beyond dogs and cats, the provider also looks after rabbits, birds, reptiles and rodents. A home visit or a "neighbourhood" walk around your home costs €19 per 30 minutes and €29 per hour (+€5 per extra dog from the same family per 30-minute block). The "nature" walk, with the dog driven to a wilder spot for an outing on a 10 m long line or off leash, costs €33 per hour or €39 for 1h30 (+€20 per extra dog from the same family). Any trip other than the pre-visit is charged €8, and a €5 to €7 surcharge applies to visits and walks on Sundays, 25 December and 1 January. Outside Fréjus and Saint-Raphaël, travel costs are €0.65 per km.</p>

      <h2>Dog training and activities</h2>
      <p>The website also offers a home behaviour assessment (€90 for a dog, about 2 hours), individual training sessions at €50 (3 sessions €145, 5 sessions €235), prevention sessions at €45 (pre-adoption, dog and cat cohabitation, moving house, a new baby), mantrailing at €45 for an individual session or €25 for a group session, and group activities at €25 per session (agility, hoopers, dog dancing, scent games, dog parkour, puppy classes) in small groups of 3 to 5 dogs. Group walks, of about 1h30, cost €20 per dog. A behaviour assessment or a sociability test (€45) is required before group activities and walks, except for mantrailing.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: for a dog that gets anxious about a change of environment, home sitting like this avoids the stress of boarding. Check, however, that no accommodation at the provider's home is offered: if that is what you are looking for, it is not available here.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The services cover Fréjus and Saint-Raphaël, between the Esterel forest and the sea.</p>
